              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kibirun Akasia kadirisa kagolake nakokuju naajai Samaria, kodekakin: kiyakia ikiyakia, kotema kes atiar, “Koloto, kiŋitut kama ejai Baal-sebub edeke loka Ekuron arai bo aŋaleuni adeka na,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
