        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi ekabaka aiyakildn ŋes ekapolon loka akaisakany, ka iketuŋa da akaisakany. Kolot mama ejai: ido koany, kiboie ŋesi kokuju oukot. Kinera kaŋes ebe, “Ŋo etuŋanan loka Edeke, ebala ekabaka ebe, ‘Kikokoror.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
