              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiyakia bobo ekapolon ece loka akaisakany ka akaisakanyike. Koboŋok kotema ŋes atiar, “Ŋo etuŋanan loka Edeke, ebala ekabaka kwanata ebe,, Kikokoror atipet.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koboŋok Eliya kotema kes atiar, “Arai arai eoŋ etuŋanan loka Edeke, kobu akim kokuju, kiewe jo ka akaisakanyikon.” Kobu akim naka Edeke kokuju, kiewe ŋes ka akaisakanyike,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
