        },
        {
          "text": " Kiyakia bobo ekapolon loka akaisakany lokiwuniet ka akaisakanyike. Kolot ekapolon lokiwuniet loka akaisakany, kobu, kokukonokin Eliya, kiŋaiŋa ŋes, kotema ŋes atiar, “Ŋo etuŋanan loka Edeke, keŋaiŋait, korau akaijar ka aijar naka akaisakany lu ikonikejaanakinak naka akais nuipu kakonyenekon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
